      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just the physical stuff though. it's everything. she works all day, then comes home and has to take care of me, and i can see it in her eyes how exhausted she is. i feel like if i wasn't even here, she could finally just live her life without constantly worrying about me or being held back by me. it's like i'm just a constant drain on her happiness.",
